# V2-10 (c) the tropics and the Mediterranean on the huge planet of seed 7, each at a place in its
# realm (`x=`, `z=`): the African savanna in its rains and in the dry season, with its herds; the
# Indian savanna; the African and the American rainforest; the Mediterranean scrub in spring and
# in the summer's drought; an oasis's date palms; then their animals, close. Seasons are the
# place's own (`season=`, `@` how far into it).
# `hearth --screenshot-list tools/shots/v210_tropical.shots`
